      "text": "Containers are easy to replace:\nCompose makes new ones on the\nnext 'up'.\n\nThe volume is the one thing you\ncan lose. Use -v only when you\nreally want a fresh, empty\ndatabase.",
      "originalText": "Containers are easy to replace:\nCompose makes new ones on the\nnext 'up'.\n\nThe volume is the one thing you\ncan lose. Use -v only when you\nreally want a fresh, empty\ndatabase.",
